      "text": "Cluster-specific Pod settings (sysctls, nodeSelectors, tolerations, imagePullSecrets, injector annotations) are injected via a corev1.PodTemplateSpec stored in a ConfigMap under the key pod-template.yaml, read on every Create call."
    },
