      ],
      "text": "Merge semantics are field-specific: the template wins for nodeSelector, tolerations, affinity, securityContext, and non-worker sidecar containers; the controller wins for ownerReferences, serviceAccountName, forced automountServiceAccountToken=false, and the agent container's image/env; labels and annotations merge with controller values overwriting on key collision."
    },
