      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_e41f6cd96025c4c8e4d9d469eb64ee5cfdd4c2d865b5d2b91b102f7509318ac6"
      ],
      "text": "AGENTTEAMS_CONTROLLER_NAME doubles as the leader-election lease name and the agentteams.io/controller label stamped on created CRs; informer caches filter by this label so multiple releases in one namespace do not reconcile each other's resources, and incluster startup without it fails fast."
    },
