      "text": "The agt CLI was rewritten as a pure REST API client calling the controller at AGENTTEAMS_CONTROLLER_URL (default http://localhost:8090), supporting CRUD for workers/teams/humans/managers, worker wake/sleep/status, YAML and ZIP apply, with tokens via AGENTTEAMS_AUTH_TOKEN or SA token file discovery."
    },
