      ],
      "text": "An embedded all-in-one image bundles Higress, Tuwunel, MinIO, Element Web, the controller, CLI, and kube-apiserver, started in layers via supervisord; deployment is dual-container (controller container plus an auto-created manager-agent container created via DockerBackend)."
