      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_13adb8927807b06291a671f37e073ba249f49492b774e1eabf6e475f4ca9fdae",
        "slc_14649bd58e4b4a3acc90ed9e77b69aa819591ee794988aeb667b7eabc238ce06",
        "slc_165f83d4f08af488bcd1adbf7e6c25eeb07a7baf01f3dfb989f90b2bad5cbc50",
        "slc_1771a556c508d82afa559610ea57afc9ceaad3f05cdc76a76d0e3a351eda8082",
        "slc_2d6a1f279ed1d1ea876aba66627d120d43d34045e556ced03f1bb4344d084076",
        "slc_6ddcd3860fb04278bf56558e99732fbb17a7cdf563ccc05b8793ee52cc921770",
        "slc_8d12c5f773e11f6a39198c6fb8d2e1bec306a897f7f8d0e04048100199894b0d"
      ],
      "text": "The refactor design gives Team Leaders heartbeat-based worker lifecycle management (wake/sleep, idle timeout) with controller-enforced permission isolation: leaders may only manage workers of their own team, and workers cannot manage other workers."
    },
